<title>CHINA: CHINA EB TECH YEAR NET RETURNS TO PROFIT.</title>
<headline>CHINA EB TECH YEAR NET RETURNS TO PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   7.6 gain     vs 10.0 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	    vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  96.56 gain   vs 6.32 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    75.80 profit vs 97.97 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     70.48	  vs 467.63</p>
<p>    Company name		 China Everbright Technology Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 8-12</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - China Everbright Technology manufactures television sets and audio products for private-label customers.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain of HK$94.14 million on disposal of subsidiaries and gain of HK$2.42 million on write-back of long outstanding creditor balances.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
